", "id": "553032207104915", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974740_553032210438248_9007250483209227513_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QFOYp-8oOSEQ7kNvwEy74FE&_nc_oc=AdqZIFPWHffswiwU-DiWfUH57d_jIocB83A9vRHlKpxQYtVjsBuSg10Aw8AFYq8VXhs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2ettCMp9GjnCtP0yxauhWpHEb_-D3aBlBur7aNP44Xng&oe=69F1E75E"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot-05.png", "id": "1063774034975181", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035371_1063774038308514_1405689482698066949_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nF07ia8OjR4Q7kNvwEC_Icn&_nc_oc=AdqwTAbE6kbIV4RPQTDtpO8eVKdXudsCCZJs7K7k_6t9C6shuLcHPyyEqwYRSlDzEYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1lKaRBDBt_hNURp1avfeJj0Bo1lkQctljBqEOKutytSA&oe=69F1F9D0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ScreenShot-01.png", "id": "8514674868623335", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9y-GsbPLMgwQ7kNvwHmPRj2&_nc_oc=AdqMbrEb7t5VhS700Xcf2PCFuwCJx66SisVNxZVPGM3YlxBOpSfC_5Bti8xYO7pRwJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1fN7M5x1QfBhOGj9l21PEOm8feL6xW1WW2zfuLQyUmmA&oe=69F206E2"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xSXTRvUz9KsQ7kNvwHyWQ0y&_nc_oc=Adr_iBwzdJHwq-eolyEUWY4i7SRjbTU1MioqfNDtqZgD7PqURLnH83Y6fUyuFTiXNkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3d4RNC57q39aLFqK4cStQGMZyjMX9hqb5ESyIGPJ1HuQ&oe=69F21473"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z1krQLrcLBQQ7kNvwFUuc-A&_nc_oc=AdqbDa5H4BIcHpaVJmXjT3agyexNXY1MvLIQ-xcICodc-88RqnYbf2VLc8smVAuiRiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0zhiJg0KR-GKE0k4tPfgNk6VAYJIlIb2jUoYoCdFYFGQ&oe=69F208EB"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_